    <string name="braden_suggested_plan">Suggested Preventive Plan:</string>
    <string name="braden_copy_clipboard">Copy to Clipboard</string>
    <string name="braden_rec_low">• Basic skin care.\n• Encourage mobility.</string>
    <string name="braden_rec_moderate">• Regular positional changes.\n• Application of Hyperoxygenated Fatty Acids (HOFA).\n• Close monitoring of pressure points.</string>
    <string name="braden_rec_high">• Positional changes every 2-3 hours.\n• Use of static/dynamic pressure-relieving surfaces.\n• Daily HOFA.\n• Nutritional supplementation if applicable.</string>
    <string name="braden_rec_very_high">• Strict positional changes every 2 hours.\n• Use of high-end dynamic pressure-relieving surfaces (alternating air mattress).\n• Heel elevation.\n• Proactive protection with multi-layer dressings.</string>
